/**
 * @mainpage Introduction
 ChibiOS - Copyright (C) 2006-2026 Giovanni Di Sirio.
 *
 * <h2>Features</h2>
 * - Virtual File System presenting file systems of different kinds as a
 *   single tree of directories and files.
 * - Root driver with a current directory, overlay drivers mounting file
 *   systems under path prefixes.
 * - File system drivers for ROMFS images, FatFS, LittleFS and streams.
 * - Object-oriented design, drivers and nodes are classes generated from XML
 *   descriptions.
 * .
 * <h2>Related pages</h2>
 * - @subpage vfs_concepts
 * - @subpage vfs_architecture
 * - @subpage concepts
 * .
